[TITLE]
NUM-33: the same six soils, two 1-in storms ten days apart.
Fmax = 0.5 in, drying time 7 days, evaporation 0.2 in/day empties the
0.05 in of depression storage between the storms.
H1, M1: decaying curve (reference); H2, M2: f0 = fmin; H3, M3: decay = 0

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
INFILTRATION         HORTON
FLOW_ROUTING         KINWAVE
START_DATE           06/01/2020
START_TIME           00:00:00
REPORT_START_DATE    06/01/2020
REPORT_START_TIME    00:00:00
END_DATE             06/12/2020
END_TIME             00:00:00
WET_STEP             00:05:00
DRY_STEP             01:00:00
REPORT_STEP          01:00:00
ROUTING_STEP         0:00:30
IGNORE_ROUTING       YES

[EVAPORATION]
CONSTANT         0.2

[RAINGAGES]
G1   INTENSITY 1:00 1.0 TIMESERIES R1

[SUBCATCHMENTS]
;;Name Gage Outlet Area %Imperv Width %Slope CurbLen
H1   G1   O1   1.0   0   100   1.0   0
H2   G1   O1   1.0   0   100   1.0   0
H3   G1   O1   1.0   0   100   1.0   0
M1   G1   O1   1.0   0   100   1.0   0
M2   G1   O1   1.0   0   100   1.0   0
M3   G1   O1   1.0   0   100   1.0   0

[SUBAREAS]
;;Name N-Imperv N-Perv S-Imperv S-Perv PctZero RouteTo
H1   0.01   0.1   0.05   0.05   0   OUTLET
H2   0.01   0.1   0.05   0.05   0   OUTLET
H3   0.01   0.1   0.05   0.05   0   OUTLET
M1   0.01   0.1   0.05   0.05   0   OUTLET
M2   0.01   0.1   0.05   0.05   0   OUTLET
M3   0.01   0.1   0.05   0.05   0   OUTLET

[INFILTRATION]
;;Name f0 fmin decay drytime(days) Fmax(in) method
H1   3.0   0.5   4   7   0.5   HORTON
H2   3.0   3.0   4   7   0.5   HORTON
H3   3.0   0.5   0   7   0.5   HORTON
M1   3.0   0.5   4   7   0.5   MODIFIED_HORTON
M2   3.0   3.0   4   7   0.5   MODIFIED_HORTON
M3   3.0   0.5   0   7   0.5   MODIFIED_HORTON

[OUTFALLS]
O1   0   FREE

[TIMESERIES]
;1 in/hr for one hour on 1 June and again on 11 June
R1   06/01/2020   0:00   1.0
R1   06/01/2020   1:00   0.0
R1   06/11/2020   0:00   1.0
R1   06/11/2020   1:00   0.0

[REPORT]
SUBCATCHMENTS ALL
